33:08.430 --> 33:10.250
♪ All I want is this moment's bloom ♪

33:08.790 --> 33:09.590
シャオ・ヤオ

33:10.790 --> 33:11.880
あなたは正しかった。

33:10.960 --> 33:12.840
"自由に成長する

33:13.790 --> 33:17.060
♪ The stars in your eyesNare the only place ♪

33:17.760 --> 33:19.620
♪ In the distance that I can see ♪

33:22.110 --> 33:23.470
♪ Don't think about ♪

33:24.110 --> 33:25.480
世界のすべてのもの

33:24.620 --> 33:26.520
